{{define "page:title"}}Display{{end}}

{{define "page:head"}}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" integrity="sha256-p4NxAoJBhIIN+hmNHrzRCf9tD/miZyoHS5obTRR9BMY=" crossorigin="">
<script defer src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js" integrity="sha256-20nQCchB9co0qIjJZRGuk2/Z9VM+kNiyxNV1lvTlZBo=" crossorigin=""></script>
<script defer src="/static/js/display.js"></script>
{{end}}

{{define "page:content"}}
<h1>Display</h1>
<div id="display-view">
<p>Received AIS observations. Estimated RF values and scenario labels are simulation data.</p>
<p id="sim-clock" class="clock">Simulation time: waiting for data</p>
<p id="live-status" role="status">Connecting...</p>
<p id="fetch-time">Browser last fetched: waiting</p>
<p id="selection-notice" role="status"></p>
<p id="empty-stations" hidden>No base stations configured. Configure sites in the simulator manager.
    {{range nav}}{{if or (eq .Label "Manager") (eq .Label "Simulator manager")}}<a href="{{.Href}}">Open manager</a>{{end}}{{end}}
</p>
<fieldset><legend>Receiving stations (multiple selections show their union)</legend>
    <button id="all-stations" type="button" aria-pressed="true">All stations</button>
    <span id="station-selection"></span>
</fieldset>
<div class="toolbar display-controls">
    <label>Coverage channel <select id="coverage-channel"><option>A</option><option>B</option></select></label>
    <label><input id="show-coverage" type="checkbox" checked> Coverage</label>
    <label><input id="show-stations" type="checkbox" checked> Stations</label>
    <label><input id="show-lost" type="checkbox"> Lost targets (last known)</label>
    <button id="fit-targets" type="button">Fit stations and targets</button>
    <button id="fit-coverage" type="button">Fit coverage</button>
</div>
<p id="coverage-legend">Estimated per-message reception, reference transmitter. Filled: 90%; dashed outline: 50%.</p>
<p id="tile-status" role="status"></p>
<div class="display-layout">
    <div id="map" aria-label="Received AIS target map"></div>
    <aside id="observation-details" aria-label="Selected observation">
        <h2 id="detail-title">Station and target details</h2>
        <pre id="detail-summary">Select a station or target.</pre>
        <div class="table-scroll"><table id="provenance-table" hidden><caption>Receiver provenance</caption>
            <thead><tr><th>Station</th><th>Last seen UTC</th><th>Transmission match</th><th>Channel / estimated power</th><th>RF revision</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody id="provenance-body"></tbody>
        </table></div>
    </aside>
</div>
<p>Markers use received AIS positions only. Grey means stale; dashed means lost and last known. No movement is predicted between reports. Simulation time is virtual UTC; browser fetch time measures connection freshness.</p>
<h2>Station comparison</h2>
<div class="toolbar">
    <label>Filter stations <input id="station-filter" type="search"></label>
    <label>Sort <select id="station-sort"><option value="name">Name</option><option value="height">Antenna height</option><option value="received">Recent received</option><option value="ratio">Recent opportunity ratio</option></select></label>
</div>
<p>More negative sensitivity means weaker signals can be received. Fresh and stale counts and last seen are from selected, retained observations; unselected sites show their combined current count. Ratios are simulated opportunities, not measured receiver quality.</p>
<div class="table-scroll"><table><caption>Receiving capabilities and observations</caption>
    <thead><tr><th>Station / ID</th><th>Status / channels</th><th>Height / gain / feeder loss</th><th>A / B sensitivity</th><th>Fresh / stale / lost</th><th>Recent received / ratio</th><th>Last seen in retained data (UTC)</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody id="station-comparison"></tbody>
</table></div>
<h2>Observed targets</h2>
<p id="target-counts">Waiting for received observations.</p>
<div class="table-scroll"><table><caption>Selected stations' received AIS targets</caption>
    <thead><tr><th>MMSI</th><th>Scenario label</th><th>Received UTC / age</th><th>State</th><th>Channel / estimated power</th><th>Received navigation</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody id="target-body"></tbody>
</table></div>
<h2>Received-signal inspector</h2>
<div class="toolbar">
    <label>Station history <select id="history-station"><option value="">Recent selection sample</option></select></label>
    <label>MMSI sample filter <input id="message-filter" type="search" inputmode="numeric"></label>
    <label><input id="pause-history" type="checkbox"> Pause inspector refresh</label>
</div>
<p>Filters apply only to the loaded sample, at most 200 successful receptions. Missed decodes appear only in station diagnostic counters. History is not an export.</p>
<p id="history-status">Recent selected reception sample.</p>
<div class="table-scroll inspector-scroll"><table><caption>Loaded successful reception sample</caption>
    <thead><tr><th>Station</th><th>Received UTC</th><th>MMSI</th><th>Type / channel</th><th>Estimated power / margin</th><th>Transmission / reception ID</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody id="message-body"></tbody>
</table></div>
<section aria-label="Received message details"><h3 id="message-title">Select a received message</h3>
    <pre id="message-summary"></pre>
    <label for="raw-nmea">Exact checksummed NMEA (including final CRLF)</label>
    <textarea id="raw-nmea" readonly rows="3" spellcheck="false"></textarea>
    <button id="copy-nmea" type="button" disabled>Copy NMEA</button>
    <span id="copy-status" role="status"></span>
</section>
<noscript>Enable JavaScript to view observations.</noscript>
</div>
{{end}}
